# BookMySpace SPA Routing & Fallback Configuration
# Ensures direct URL access and browser refresh resolve to index.html with HTTP 200.

# Pass-through for well-known association files and static resources
/.well-known/* /.well-known/:splat 200
/icons/* /icons/:splat 200
/assets/* /assets/:splat 200

# SPA Fallback rule for HTML5 / GoRouter deep paths
/* /index.html 200
